title: Agent Notebooks + Model Cascading — The Speed/Cost Revolution
summary: 'Two breakthrough ideas: (1) Agent notebooks — curated snippet libraries distilled from lore, providing O(1) knowledge retrieval instead of O(n) exploration. Notebooks are transferable across projects with concept-level adaptation. (2) Model cascading — orchestrator computes minimum viable model per task using complexity scoring (novelty, scope, risk, confidence, context quality). Perfect context from notebooks+protocols enables Haiku to produce Opus-quality results. Self-improving: cascade outcomes feed back into scoring. Projected impact: 4x faster, 8x cheaper with same quality for 60%+ of routine tasks.'
